<!--
  CycloneDDS profile — SHM enabled (iceoryx integration).

  Engages iceoryx as the local-host transport. iox-roudi must be
  running BEFORE any participant opens: run_bench.sh starts it as a
  background process before the cyclonedds+shm batch and kills it
  after. NOTE on the absent-roudi failure mode: iceoryx's
  initRuntime() WAITS for RouDi (and classically TERMINATES the
  process after its wait budget) — a "silently falls back to UDP"
  reading is not supported by
  the iceoryx runtime-registration design; check the actual per-distro
  behavior on your machine (either way, verify_shm.sh's roudi-delta
  gate catches a participant that came up without SHM engagement).

  Cross-distro validity of the <SharedMemory>
  element: on humble/jazzy (CycloneDDS 0.10.5) this is the
  built-in iceoryx bridge's native config. On lyrical (CycloneDDS
  11.0.1) the built-in bridge was replaced by the PSMX plugin
  interface, and <SharedMemory><Enable>true</Enable> is a DEPRECATED
  but FULLY FUNCTIONAL alias: convert_deprecated_sharedmemory() in
  src/core/ddsi/src/ddsi_config.c (releases/11.0.x) converts it into
  the IDENTICAL in-tree psmx_iox instance the modern
  <PubSubMessageExchange name="iox" library="psmx_iox"> syntax would
  create — same plugin, same defaults, Prefix default "DDS_CYCLONE"
  becoming INSTANCE_NAME (which is what keeps verify_shm.sh's
  DDS_CYCLONE roudi grep valid on every distro). Running lyrical
  through this alias is byte-equivalent to the modern syntax, NOT a
  degraded legacy path. If anyone modernizes this file to
  <PubSubMessageExchange>, they MUST set SERVICE_NAME=DDS_CYCLONE or
  the iceoryx service name silently becomes the `name` attribute and
  the structural verify loses its marker.

  Tracing/Verbosity is set to "info" so verify_shm.sh can grep the
  iceoryx engagement marker in CYCLONEDDS_LOG output. (In practice
  the apt builds print no iceoryx marker of their own — engagement is
  verified via iox-roudi's debug log; see verify_shm.sh.)
-->
<CycloneDDS xmlns="https://cdds.io/config"
            xmlns:xsi="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema-instance"
            xsi:schemaLocation="https://cdds.io/config https://raw.githubusercontent.com/eclipse-cyclonedds/cyclonedds/master/etc/cyclonedds.xsd">
  <Domain id="any">
    <SharedMemory>
      <Enable>true</Enable>
      <LogLevel>info</LogLevel>
    </SharedMemory>
    <Tracing>
      <Verbosity>info</Verbosity>
    </Tracing>
  </Domain>
</CycloneDDS>
